<ul>
<li>
  Usually not capitalized in Russian in the sense of
  <a href="/wiki/idol" title="idol">
   idol
  </a>
  , or when referring to a single god with a polytheistic pantheon. It is normally capitalized in monotheistic sense, such as in Christian or Islamic discourse (see
  <i class="Cyrl mention" lang="ru">
<a href="/wiki/%D0%91%D0%BE%D0%B3#Russian" title="Бог">
    Бог
   </a>
</i>
<span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">
